{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1000_p", "source_sha256": "0baccb8bdc85d6abcb287c62fb5849fb505b09e989f39b9a1e941dea0c511ca5", "ja": "（新しいMVの参考にするために、\nあずささんと夏祭りにやってきた）", "zh": "（为了参考新MV，\n我和梓小姐一起来到了夏日祭典）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1001_p", "source_sha256": "b262550bcb497f5e75b5206f7f7c7b24978bf786d26d3e50fe565a5f55039bd0", "ja": "いやぁ、やっぱり夏祭りの雰囲気はいいですね。\nいろんな出店がありますよ！", "zh": "哎呀，夏日祭典的氛围果然很好呢。\n有好多不同的小摊位哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1002_010azu", "source_sha256": "a47d49dbbdec72cf621cc527d146dff4387179884e40b8a9efafb77a5c81a7f3", "ja": "うふふっ、{$P$}さん、\nはしゃぎすぎですよ♪　あっ、水風船がありますね。", "zh": "呵呵，{$P$}先生，\n您也太兴奋啦♪　啊，有水气球呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1003_p", "source_sha256": "6caad4b5178a304a04e39f6fc7fcd33c5441dce3d7a53f0460dc75d8ef03e92b", "ja": "おお、夏祭りの定番ですよね！", "zh": "哦，夏日祭典的经典项目呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1004_010azu", "source_sha256": "fcb711d7d7004e0babe9b6eac45db3901ef32cc65ef2bf112abdc9d04335314f", "ja": "私、水風船が大好きなんです。\n色とりどりで、とってもかわいらしいですね。", "zh": "我超喜欢水气球的。\n五颜六色的，真的好可爱呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1005_p", "source_sha256": "6eef2f4e414be4b54ea1addb1b83c87da082eb63102b79942df06c4763a57a17", "ja": "それじゃあ、ちょっとやっていきますか？", "zh": "那么，我们来玩一会儿吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1006_010azu", "source_sha256": "c87f60b322faac1073c7f2dfbdd85344d8fdcdbbe76fc5ecd20f97d1165e7bd6", "ja": "あ、水風船は好きなんですけど、取るのは苦手で……。\nきっと今回も取れないと思いますから……。", "zh": "啊，我喜欢水气球，不过不太擅长把它们捞起来……  \n这次肯定也捞不到吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1007_p", "source_sha256": "f8f8c1bc0577b5e8feccbf3a050ec11f36a5456b38ca12835bbbaf771aa50157", "ja": "だったら俺が代わりにやりますよ。\n頑張れば、ふたつかみっつ、いけると思います。", "zh": "那我来替您做吧。\n只要努力一下，我觉得应该能拿到两三个。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1008_010azu", "source_sha256": "26034de1f5055bfa1978d15d24220163888371031e7bbb7eb5c76c8d435e1b91", "ja": "まあ、ありがとうございます！\nでしたら、その紫の子をふたつ、お迎えできたら……。", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢您！\n要是可以的话，能帮我带两个那个紫色的小家伙回去就太好了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1009_p", "source_sha256": "972bdf1da9374d14a2394cde3ecf0e761af3f3e71062f9ee06fd3b527394c718", "ja": "紫をふたつですね。よし、やってみましょう。\nでも久しぶりだなぁ。腕が鳴ります！", "zh": "是两个紫色的啊。好，试试看。不过还真是好久没做了，手都痒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "e679785fa3035d93dcbabd6502c88e785dae6352c391953e71dd0386d15f93b3", "ja": "頑張ってくださいね、{$P$}さん。\n私、後ろで応援してますから！", "zh": "加油哦，{$P$}先生。我会在后面为你加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1011_010azu", "source_sha256": "137800621c698b07a41b106831082c532facf08438b32af1032f2858a4c9227e", "ja": "ふふふっ。\n紫のかわいい子がふたつも……ふふ♪", "zh": "呵呵呵。\n居然有两个紫色的可爱小家伙……呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1012_p", "source_sha256": "8ff228614939ed24173c9f0d1158bbdd41fdc6104c9912bcab03fb81abe71acc", "ja": "あずささん、とってもごきげんですね。水風船で、\nそんなに喜んでもらえるとは思いませんでした。", "zh": "梓小姐，心情真好啊。没想到您会因为水气球这么开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1013_010azu", "source_sha256": "ad34a8709b5b6f46842f1da00e30b091d4fd680d0ed91d6478624078308ce538", "ja": "{$P$}さんが取ってくれたん\nですもの。うれしいに決まってます♪", "zh": "这可是{$P$}先生为我钓到的，\n我当然会很开心啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "87d25726f18c67ed8c129569ad5afd141ca317e3bb9f4146ca469dc6dc68f58f", "ja": "私のために、あんなに頑張ってくださって……、\nとっても素敵でしたよ♪　ありがとうございます。", "zh": "您为了我那么努力……真的非常棒呢♪ 谢谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1015_p", "source_sha256": "388e3214dc336904a44e1393084e74494ce3d68748c2a40f29355a3408091cad", "ja": "なんの、お安い御用ですよ。でも、どうして\n同じ色の水風船をふたつ欲しかったんですか？", "zh": "哪里的话，小事一桩。不过，您为什么想要两个同样颜色的水球呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1016_010azu", "source_sha256": "6526eaffc6b07562d8bbcd788991965fd1f2f33d0a27041ef91dd402fe65f364", "ja": "それは……。\nやっぱり、お揃いがいいなと思って。", "zh": "因为……  \n我还是觉得，成对的比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1017_010azu", "source_sha256": "3ae251b3abdc48c9db8d6ea0f6424c47b4ee9e63f7e18148aa53cfa335fd2682", "ja": "ですから、ひとつは{$P$}さんが\n持っていてくださいね。はい、どうぞ。", "zh": "所以，这一个请{$P$}先生拿着哦。来，给你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1018_p", "source_sha256": "cf0277784724c5fab9e251747a2df2778983d196b46fd8f15d316e498467c591", "ja": "えっ？　……ありがとうございます。\nあずささんとお揃いの水風船か……大事にしよう。", "zh": "咦？……谢谢您。\n和梓小姐的是一对的水气球吗……我会好好珍惜的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_010azu0173_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_010azu0173_1019_010azu", "source_sha256": "d4efcf6fc5fb24be9d05b3812d15bfc18ddd8749114e6584395373999e505116", "ja": "私も、ずっと大事にします。\n今日の素敵な思い出が、しぼんでしまわないように♪", "zh": "我也会一直珍惜它。可别让今天美好的回忆也跟着一起瘪掉哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
